From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ysfaculty <haejin.cho@yonsei.ac.kr>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 15:25:31 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 153/160] hjviewer: no pilot notice in the app (1.9.1)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The service is an official one now (the owner's decision of 2026-10-26), so
Settings → About on the desktop and the phones no longer says that it is a
pilot implementation. It keeps who makes HJViewer ("만든 곳: 프로젝트TF") and, in
an account build with a signed policy's contact, "HJViewer 관리자: <contact>".
The login dialog's block already said only which password goes in (U31); its
hook keeps its name.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
